14
00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:20,460
Lekin har baar nahi!

15
00:00:20,460 --> 00:00:21,920
Iska intezaar mat karo.

16
00:00:22,080 --> 00:00:24,540
Gehra kaanta, barhti laali,

17
00:00:24,540 --> 00:00:25,830
